layback works as expected.  \n\nSo perhaps we don't always want to proactively fail playback in all cases?\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/250148434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"theBradfo","id":681790,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTc5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/681790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo","html_url":"https://github.com/theBradfo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theBradfo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/259885848","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1789#issuecomment-259885848","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1789","id":259885848,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI1OTg4NTg0OA==","user":{"login":"meenapola","id":23394076,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzk0MDc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23394076?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola","html_url":"https://github.com/meenapola","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-11-11T05:44:28Z","updated_at":"2016-11-11T05:44:28Z","body":"1) In my experience so far, some of the live stream providers are still supporting protocol version 3,\n e.g., UFC and AOL. We see EXT-X-DISCONTINUITY without EXT-X-DISCONTINUITY-SEQUENCE tag, a lot\n\n2) Interestingly, y'day I encountered EXT-X-DISCONTINUITY @ the beginning of a growing live playlist.\nexoplayer(2.0.4) was able to playback the content without a hiccup.\n#EXTM3U\n#EXT-X-VERSION:3\n#EXT-X-TARGETDURATION:7\n#EXT-X-MEDIA-SEQUENCE:1418\n#EXT-X-PLAYLIST-TYPE:EVENT\n#EXT-X-DISCONTINUITY\n#EXTINF:0.033,\n20161108T165357/index-500/00000/index-500_01418.ts\n#EXTINF:6.006,\n20161108T165357/index-500/00000/index-500_01419.ts\n#EXTINF:6.006,\n20161108T165357/index-500/00000/index-500_01420.ts\n...\n...\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/259885848/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"meenapola","id":23394076,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzk0MDc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23394076?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola","html_url":"https://github.com/meenapola","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meenapola/followers","following_u